      "node_id": "kg_doc_4",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Model Shop is a 1969 American film by French writer-director Jacques Demy starring Gary Lockwood, Alexandra Hay and Anouk Aimée and featuring a guest appearance by Spirit who also recorded the soundtrack. Demy made \"Model Shop\", which was his first English-language film, following the international success of his film, \"The Umbrellas of Cherbourg\". Aimée reprises the title role from Demy's 1960 French-language film \"Lola\".",
